WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
Hey, I'm Marco, I'm the CEO of Northline

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.520
Studio.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.900
So, when we brought Pixel2Tech in, we

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.120
needed honestly everything, the branding,

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.000
the build, the launch, the whole thing.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.320
And I'll be real with you, I was a little

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.270
nervous, you know, because a lot of teams

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.430
promise you the world and then they

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:24.600
disappear.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.910
But these guys, every single thing they

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:31.310
said they do, they did, from the branding

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:34.680
all the way to launch, every promise

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:35.600
delivered.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.740
And that's the thing, they don't feel

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:39.880
like a vendor, like at all, they feel

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.490
like a partner, like they actually care

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:44.000
if we grow, you know?

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.360
So yeah, if you're thinking about working

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.000
with them, don't overthink it, just do it.
